00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:40,680
 And then in math, we would say the dual.

527
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:43,880
 The space around the space we just structured

528
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:47,360
 are the guardrails around AI transactions and actions.

