00:21:55,320 --> 00:21:57,520
 without direct human oversight or supervision.

532
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:59,440
 I don't know exactly how long it's gonna take to get there,

533
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:02,200
 but you're gonna have an AI that's going out there.

