 if it discovers honkaku.net doesn't realize it's,

571
00:23:17,840 --> 00:23:19,400
 you know, not real and you know,

572
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:21,960
 sort of buys like 10,000 copies of books or something.

573
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:24,960
 And then I get this huge empty book box

