00:36:49,240 --> 00:36:51,240
 and the way information gets surfaced

907
00:36:51,240 --> 00:36:53,600
 is through LLMs, which do not provide attribution

908
00:36:53,600 --> 00:36:55,680
 back to those original content sources,

909
00:36:55,680 --> 00:36:57,040
 there's no incentive for creators

910
00:36:57,040 --> 00:36:58,160
 to provide that content for free.

911
00:36:58,160 --> 00:37:00,120
 So what you see is increasingly things are put

912
00:37:00,120 --> 00:37:02,800
 behind paywalls, but also you can see

913
